Abbreviation tables
  The default abbreviation labels in crates/rdoxide/src/graphmol/abbreviations.rs are
  copied from RDKit's Abbreviations module (BSD-3-Clause), which adapted them from the
  superatom table of Open Babel (https://github.com/openbabel/superatoms), originally
  from the OSRA project (http://cactus.nci.nih.gov/osra/). Only short label/SMILES
  pairs are carried over; no Open Babel code is used.
